AppTaskImpl.getTaskInfo() previously bypassed permission checks
and hardcoded getTasksAllowed=true when fetching task info. This
allowed callers of AppTaskImpl to view top activity details even
when topActivityUid differed from the task's effectiveUid.

This change:
1. Enforces mService.isGetTasksAllowed(callingPid, callingUid)
   inside AppTaskImpl.getTaskInfo().
2. Redacts pictureInPictureParams, mTopActivityLocusId, and
   taskDescription in Task.trimIneffectiveInfo() when top activity
   UID differs from task effectiveUid and getTasksAllowed is false.

Flag: EXEMPT BUGFIX
Bug: 527037031
Test: atest WmTests:AppTaskImplTests WmTests:TaskTests
